 ucm2/Intel/bytcr-wm5102/HiFi.conf      | 11 ++++++++++-
 ucm2/codecs/wm5102/EnableSeq.conf      |  2 ++
 ucm2/codecs/wm5102/HPOut2-Speaker.conf | 22 ++++++++++++++++++++++
